<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ahmad Mahmoud Saleh's Space</title><link>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/</link><description>Recent content on Ahmad Mahmoud Saleh's Space</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Jun 2022 00:00:23 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ahmadmssm.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kotlin Multiplatform</title><link>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/miscellaneous/kmm/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jun 2022 00:00:23 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/miscellaneous/kmm/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I never thought I would write an article to praise mobile a cross-platform mobile framework, well, Kotlin Multiplatform allowed this to happen!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Throughout my career in mobile development, I faced multiple situations where I had to maintain applications built with cross-platform frameworks such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oracles Mobile Application Framework (AKA: &lt;a href="https://www.oracle.com/application-development/technologies/maf/oraclemaf.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;MAF&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; a framework based on PhoneGap by Oracle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://reactnative.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;React Native&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; by Facebook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also briefly checked technologies such as &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Titanium&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; by Appcelerator and &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; by Google.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android Generic Analytics</title><link>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/android/analytics/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jul 2021 00:00:23 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/android/analytics/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="complete-post-coming-soon"&gt;Complete Post Coming Soon&amp;hellip;&lt;/h3&gt;</description></item><item><title>Best practices for effective code review</title><link>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/software-engineering/code-review/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jul 2021 00:00:23 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/software-engineering/code-review/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="complete-post-coming-soon"&gt;Complete Post Coming Soon&amp;hellip;&lt;/h3&gt;</description></item><item><title>Create Apple App Store Account</title><link>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/how-to/create-apple-app-store-account/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jul 2021 00:00:23 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://ahmadmssm.github.io/posts/how-to/create-apple-app-store-account/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="complete-post-coming-soon"&gt;Complete Post Coming Soon&amp;hellip;&lt;/h3&gt;
